&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;Authorization&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;#Don&amp;#39;t pass the Nginx Basic Auth to ESXi or it will break VMRC.
